---
import { TextSection } from '@components/odyssey-theme';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Page.astro';

const seo = {
  title: `Legal Page | SocialScape LTD`,
  description: `Read the legal terms and policies for SocialScape LTD, a capital-raising and lead-generation firm.`,
};
---

<Layout seo={seo}>
  <TextSection narrow>
    <h1> - Legal Disclaimer</h1>
    <p>
      This legal disclaimer governs your use of SocialScape LTD’s website and services. By accessing or using our
      services, you agree to the terms outlined in this document. Please read it carefully. If you do not agree with
      any part of these terms, do not use our website or services.
    </p>

    <h2> - About SocialScape LTD</h2>
    <p>
      SocialScape LTD is a capital-raising and lead-generation firm, registered in Ireland. Our services are designed to
      connect businesses with potential investors and provide tailored solutions for securing investment.
    </p>

    <h2> - No Financial Advice</h2>
    <p>
      SocialScape LTD does not provide financial, investment, legal, or tax advice. Any content on this website,
      including articles, case studies, or blog posts, is for informational purposes only and should not be construed as
      professional advice. We strongly recommend consulting with qualified financial advisors, accountants, or legal
      professionals before making any financial or investment decisions.
    </p>

    <h2> - Limitations of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      SocialScape LTD is not liable for any damages, losses, or liabilities arising from:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>The use or inability to use our website or services.</li>
      <li>Errors, inaccuracies, or omissions in our content.</li>
      <li>Third-party links, services, or actions.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      While we strive to provide accurate and up-to-date information, SocialScape LTD does not guarantee the
      completeness, reliability, or accuracy of our content.
    </p>

    <h2> - Confidentiality and Data Protection</h2>
    <p>
      SocialScape LTD adheres to GDPR regulations and ensures the confidentiality of all client information. Any
      personal or corporate data provided to us is handled securely and used solely for the purposes agreed upon in our
      engagement contracts. For more details, refer to our Privacy Policy.
    </p>

    <h2> - Third-Party Involvement</h2>
    <p>
      SocialScape LTD works with third-party investors, advisors, and strategic partners. We are not responsible for the
      actions, decisions, or advice provided by these third parties. All interactions with external parties introduced
      through SocialScape LTD are at your own discretion.
    </p>

    <h2> - No Guarantee of Results</h2>
    <p>
      Our capital-raising and lead-generation services are designed to maximize opportunities, but success is subject to
      market conditions, investor interest, and business fundamentals. SocialScape LTD does not guarantee any specific
      results, funding amounts, or investor commitments.
    </p>

    <h2> - Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>
      All content on this website, including logos, trademarks, and materials, is the intellectual property of
      SocialScape LTD unless otherwise stated. Unauthorized use, reproduction, or distribution of this content is
      prohibited.
    </p>

    <h2> - Governing Law</h2>
    <p>
      This legal disclaimer and any disputes arising from the use of SocialScape LTD’s website or services are governed
      by the laws of Ireland. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the Irish courts.
    </p>

    <h2> - Changes to Terms</h2>
    <p>
      SocialScape LTD reserves the right to modify this legal disclaimer at any time without prior notice. Changes will
      be effective immediately upon posting. Please review this page periodically to stay informed.
    </p>

    <h2> - Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      For any questions or concerns regarding this legal disclaimer or our services, please contact us:
    </p>
    <address>
      <strong>SocialScape LTD</strong><br />
      Email: <a href="mailto:info@trysocialscape.co.uk">info@socialscape.com</a><br />
      Address: Unit 3D North Point House,
      North Point Business Park,
      New Mallow Road, Cork
      T23 AT2P
      Ireland

    </address>
  </TextSection>
</Layout>
